      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucas%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town was officially platted on May 9, 1868 and incorporated on March 18, 1887, marking its formal establishment.",
